    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "team_0040_select_02",
      "hash64": "8DFCAA7950E4C1F1",
      "text": "Garoff...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_02",
      "hash64": "59AB8202A7EA8494",
      "text": "Come ti ho già detto, io sono Garoff. Niente di\\nmeno e niente di più.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_03",
      "hash64": "59AB8302A7EA8647",
      "text": "Esatto, sono Garoff. Te lo sei ricordato, brav[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_04",
      "hash64": "59AB8002A7EA812E",
      "text": "Comunque devo ringraziarti, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_05",
      "hash64": "59AB8102A7EA82E1",
      "text": "Per merito tuo posso partecipare all’Operazione\\nStardust.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "team_0040_select_03",
      "hash64": "8DFCA97950E4C03E",
      "text": "Come mai?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0040_select_04",
      "hash64": "8DFCAC7950E4C557",
      "text": "A che scopo?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_06",
      "hash64": "59AB7E02A7EA7DC8",
      "text": "Voglio fare chiarezza sulla questione del Team\\nStar... e sul mistero che lo circonda.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "team_0040_select_05",
      "hash64": "8DFCAB7950E4C3A4",
      "text": "Che questione?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0040_select_06",
      "hash64": "8DFCAE7950E4C8BD",
      "text": "Che mistero?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_07",
      "hash64": "59AB7F02A7EA7F7B",
      "text": "Circolano un sacco di voci su di loro...\\c\\nHo sentito che hanno bullizzato degli studenti\\nfino a fargli lasciare la scuola.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "59AB7C02A7EA7A62",
      "text": "E poi sembra che passino il tempo chiusi nelle\\nloro basi a tramare contro la nostra accademia...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "59AB7D02A7EA7C15",
      "text": "Ma in fin dei conti sono solo dicerie.\\nOra il problema più grosso è un altro.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "59AEEA02A7ED6B23",
      "text": "Le continue assenze ingiustificate dei membri\\ndel Team Star... È un pezzo ormai che non si\\r\\nfanno più vedere a scuola.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "59AEE902A7ED6970",
      "text": "Cinque di loro in particolare, i capibanda,\\nnon vengono a scuola da più di un anno.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "59AEEC02A7ED6E89",
      "text": "Inoltre, parrebbe che di recente le Reclute\\nabbiano iniziato a combinare mascalzonate...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "59AEEB02A7ED6CD6",
      "text": "È per questo che ho intimato al Team Star\\ndi sciogliersi.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "59AEEE02A7ED71EF",
      "text": "E li ho ben avvisati che, se dovessero ignorare\\nil mio ordine, non avrei altra scelta che espellere\\r\\ntutti i membri dall’accademia...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "59AEED02A7ED703C",
      "text": "Ma non ho ancora ricevuto risposta e la scadenza\\nche gli ho dato per decidere se preferiscano\\r\\nsciogliersi o essere cacciati si avvicina.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "59AEF002A7ED7555",
      "text": "Poi, provvidenzialmente, mi è capitato di udire\\nla telefonata tra lei e Cassiopea... ehm...\\r\\ntra te e Cassiopea, volevo dire.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "team_0040_system_01",
      "hash64": "E9FA55E86C3AB05B",
      "text": "Rotoroto-rotoroto-rotoroto...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_01",
      "hash64": "1B07436709C75031",
      "text": "Sono io, Cassiopea. Mi senti, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_17",
      "hash64": "59AEEF02A7ED73A2",
      "text": "Gah![VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "team_0040_nelke_18",
      "hash64": "59AEF202A7ED78BB",
      "text": "Psst psst... (Ti racconterò il resto un’altra volta.)\\nPsst psst... (Buona fortuna!)[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 8,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_02",
      "hash64": "1B07406709C74B18",
      "text": "Vedo che sei vicin[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa a una delle basi del Team\\nStar. Per caso c’era qualcuno lì con te?[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0040_select_07",
      "hash64": "8DFCAD7950E4C70A",
      "text": "No, nessuno!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "team_0040_select_08",
      "hash64": "8DFCA07950E4B0F3",
      "text": "No, solo io!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_03",
      "hash64": "1B07416709C74CCB",
      "text": "Comunque... Ora che hai sconfitto uno dei loro\\ncapi, il Team Star sarà molto più all’erta.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_04",
      "hash64": "1B07466709C7554A",
      "text": "Prevedo che le prossime basi saranno più\\ndifficili da conquistare.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "team_0040_cassiopeia_05",
      "hash64": "1B07476709C756FD",
      "text": "Mi raccomando, fai attenzione. A risentirci.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
